<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-JAMAICA AND INDIA DRAW FOUR-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-JAMAICA AND INDIA DRAW FOUR-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica and India drew their four-day match which ended at Sabina Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Jamaica 453-9 declared and 190-4 (L.Garrick 108, J.Adams 53 not out); India 323 (V.V.Laxman 98, R.Dravid 86, S.Ganguly 82)</p>
